{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "OA Corp Sales：聯絡記錄常用詞𢑥填寫按鈕",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "(corp-sales-contact-memo-btn) 在聯絡記錄 modal 的文字框旁注入常用詞快速填寫按鈕",
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://corp.orangeapple.co/marketing/sales*"
